## Application Types

Accom develops three types of backend applications. Every project README **must** state which type it is.

| Type | Framework | Purpose | Example |
|------|-----------|---------|---------|
| **Laravel API** | Laravel 11/12 + Passport | REST APIs for mobile/frontend apps | `git@bitbucket.org:we-accom/abla.git` |
| **Laravel Admin Panel** | Laravel 11/12 + Filament (new) / Orchid (legacy) | Internal management interfaces | `git@bitbucket.org:we-accom/ama.git` |
| **CodeIgniter 4 Website** | CodeIgniter 4 | Simple commercial websites (≤1 DB) | `git@bitbucket.org:we-accom/tarifasdeluzygas.es.git` |
| **Python Process** | Python 3.12 | Standalone data-intensive processes | `/python` dir inside Laravel projects |

